  "title": "Jiayin Group Inc. to Release First Quarter 2026 Unaudited Financial Results on Tuesday, June 23, 2026",
  "summary": "SHANGHAI, June 12, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Jiayin Group Inc. (\"Jiayin\" or the \"Company\") (NASDAQ: JFIN), a leading fintech platform in China, today announced that it will release its unaudited financial results for the first quarter of 2026 before the U.S. market opens on Tuesday, June 23, 2026.",
